            "value" : "取消触发订单"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel sent for the old stop-loss, but Perpl hasn't confirmed it, so the new one wasn't placed (that could leave two). Check Orders: if the old one is gone, this position has no stop-loss now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se envió la cancelación del stop loss anterior, pero Perpl no la ha confirmado, así que no se colocó el nuevo (podrían quedar dos). Revisa Órdenes: si el anterior ya no está, esta posición ahora no tiene stop loss."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Annulation de l'ancien stop loss envoyée, mais Perpl ne l'a pas confirmée : le nouveau n'a donc pas été placé (il pourrait sinon y en avoir deux). Vérifiez l'onglet Ordres : si l'ancien a disparu, cette position n'a plus de stop loss."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "기존 손절 주문의 취소 요청을 보냈지만 Perpl이 아직 확인하지 않아 새 주문을 넣지 않았습니다(손절 주문이 두 개 남을 수 있기 때문입니다). ‘주문’ 탭을 확인하십시오. 기존 주문이 없어졌다면 현재 이 포지션에는 손절 주문이 없습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已发送旧止损的取消请求，但 Perpl 尚未确认，因此新止损未下单（否则可能同时存在两个）。查看“委托”：如果旧止损已不在，该仓位现在没有止损。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel sent for the old take-profit, but Perpl hasn't confirmed it, so the new one wasn't placed (that could leave two). Check Orders: if the old one is gone, this position has no take-profit now." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
