    "Check Orders: its stop-loss may still be armed." : {
      "comment" : "A Perps order sheet's warning under an order that executed nothing: it isn't confirmed that Perpl cancelled the order's stop-loss with it, so it may still be active and act on a later position. Orders is a tab of the Perps screen.",
      "localizations" : {
