    "Close status unknown — Perpl didn't confirm this close, so it may have gone through. Check Positions before closing again." : {
      "comment" : "Close Position sheet and the Perps status row: the close was sent but Perpl never answered it. Positions is a tab of the Perps screen.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Estado del cierre desconocido: Perpl no confirmó este cierre, así que puede que se haya ejecutado. Revisa Posiciones antes de volver a cerrar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Statut de la clôture inconnu — Perpl n'a pas confirmé cette clôture, elle a donc peut-être été exécutée. Vérifiez Positions avant de clôturer à nouveau."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "종료 상태를 알 수 없습니다 — Perpl이 이 종료 주문을 확인하지 않아 이미 처리되었을 수 있습니다. 다시 종료하기 전에 포지션을 확인하십시오."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "平仓状态未知：Perpl 未确认此次平仓，因此它可能已经执行。再次平仓前，先查看“仓位”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
