    "Confirmed on Monad, but nothing filled" : {
      "comment" : "A Perps Activity row's subtitle, also a sent transaction's status in Recent Activity: the order's transaction confirmed on Monad, but none of the order executed (nothing on the order book within its slippage). Only the network fee was spent.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Transacción confirmada en Monad, pero no se ejecutó nada"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Transaction confirmée sur Monad, mais rien n'a été exécuté"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Monad에서 확인됐지만 아무것도 체결되지 않음"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已在 Monad 上确认，但没有成交"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Confirmed on Monad, but the result couldn't be read. Check the position." : {
      "comment" : "The Add Margin sheet's result line: the transaction confirmed on Monad, but the margin it added couldn't be read from it. The position card shows its margin.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Transacción confirmada en Monad, pero no se pudo leer el resultado. Revisa la posición."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Transaction confirmée sur Monad, mais le résultat n'a pas pu être lu. Vérifiez la position."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Monad에서 확인되었지만 결과를 읽을 수 없습니다. 포지션을 확인하십시오."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已在 Monad 上确认，但无法读取结果。查看该仓位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Confirmed on Monad. The result couldn't be read — check Positions." : {
      "comment" : "A Perps sheet's result line: the order's transaction confirmed on Monad, but what it did (filled or not) couldn't be read from it. Positions is a tab of the Perps screen.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Transacción confirmada en Monad. No se pudo leer el resultado: revisa Posiciones."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Transaction confirmée sur Monad. Le résultat n'a pas pu être lu — vérifiez Positions."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Monad에서 확인되었습니다. 결과를 읽을 수 없습니다. 포지션을 확인하십시오."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已在 Monad 上确认。无法读取结果 — 查看“仓位”。"
          }
        }
      }
