          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "创作者税在曲线交易中收取，毕业后也会在 Uniswap v4 池子的兑换中收取。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Creator tax is charged on curve trades only. %@ After graduation the Monday Trade pool's 1%% fee goes to DyorHQ: there is no creator tax or fee share in the pool." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El impuesto del creador solo se cobra en las operaciones en la curva. %@ Tras la graduación, la comisión del 1%% del pool de Monday Trade va a DyorHQ: en el pool no hay impuesto del creador ni reparto de comisiones."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La taxe du créateur s'applique uniquement aux transactions sur la courbe. %@ Après la graduation, les frais de 1%% du pool Monday Trade reviennent à DyorHQ : il n'y a ni taxe du créateur ni partage des frais dans le pool."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "크리에이터 세금은 커브 거래에만 부과돼요. %@ 졸업 후에는 Monday Trade 풀의 수수료 1%%가 DyorHQ에 돌아가며, 풀에는 크리에이터 세금이나 수수료 분배가 없어요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "创作者税仅在曲线交易中收取。%@毕业后，Monday Trade 池子的 1%% 手续费归 DyorHQ：池子中没有创作者税或手续费分成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
