    "It expired before graduating, so its coins never vest. Your editions stay yours." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Expiró antes de graduarse, así que sus monedas nunca se liberan. Tus ediciones siguen siendo tuyas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il a expiré avant sa graduation : ses jetons ne seront donc jamais débloqués. Vos éditions restent à vous."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "졸업 전에 만료되어 코인은 베스팅되지 않아요. 에디션은 계속 내 소유예요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它在毕业前已过期，因此其币永远不会解锁。你收藏的份仍归你所有。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It has sent %lld transactions, so it may also hold positions, collateral or coins not shown here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "It has sent %lld transaction, so it may also hold positions, collateral or coins not shown here."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "It has sent %lld transactions, so it may also hold positions, collateral or coins not shown here."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Ha enviado %lld transacción, así que también puede tener posiciones, colateral o monedas que no se muestran aquí."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Ha enviado %lld transacciones, así que también puede tener posiciones, colateral o monedas que no se muestran aquí."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Il a envoyé %lld transaction : il peut donc aussi détenir des positions, des garanties ou des jetons non affichés ici."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Il a envoyé %lld transactions : il peut donc aussi détenir des positions, des garanties ou des jetons non affichés ici."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "이 지갑은 트랜잭션을 %lld건 보냈으므로, 여기에 표시되지 않은 포지션, 담보 또는 코인을 보유하고 있을 수도 있어요."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "它已发送过 %lld 笔交易，因此可能还持有此处未显示的仓位、抵押品或币。"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its Moment hasn't graduated yet, so the coin has no market. It trades once the Moment graduates." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Su Moment aún no se ha graduado, así que la moneda no tiene mercado. Se podrá operar cuando el Moment se gradúe."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Son Moment n'est pas encore gradué : le jeton n'a donc pas de marché. Il sera échangeable une fois le Moment gradué."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Moment가 아직 졸업하지 않아 이 코인은 시장이 없어요. Moment가 졸업하면 거래할 수 있어요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它的 Moment 尚未毕业，因此该币还没有市场。Moment 毕业后即可交易。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its collecting window ended before it graduated, so its coins never vest. Your editions stay yours." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Su plazo de colección terminó antes de que se graduara, así que sus monedas nunca se liberan. Tus ediciones siguen siendo tuyas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sa période de collecte s'est terminée avant sa graduation : ses jetons ne seront donc jamais débloqués. Vos éditions restent à vous."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "졸업 전에 수집 기간이 끝나 코인은 베스팅되지 않아요. 에디션은 계속 내 소유예요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它的收藏期在毕业前已结束，因此其币永远不会解锁。你收藏的份仍归你所有。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its stop-loss is still armed with no position to close. Cancel it so it can't act on a later position." : {
      "comment" : "A Perps order sheet's warning under an order that executed nothing: Perpl still has its stop-loss armed. A Cancel button follows.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Su stop loss sigue activo sin ninguna posición que cerrar. Cancélalo para que no actúe sobre una posición posterior."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Son stop loss est toujours actif sans position à clôturer. Annulez-le pour qu'il ne puisse pas agir sur une position ultérieure."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "손절 주문이 종료할 포지션 없이 아직 활성 상태입니다. 이후 포지션에 작동하지 않도록 취소하십시오."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其止损仍有效，但没有可平的仓位。取消它，以免它作用于之后的仓位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its stop-loss was cancelled with it." : {
      "comment" : "A Perps order sheet's line under an order that executed nothing: Perpl cancelled the order's stop-loss too.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Su stop loss se canceló con ella."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
