    "One-time security upgrade: enter the code we emailed to %@. Your account then moves to the new wallet your new password creates. Your previous wallet (%@) stays behind, and so does its public profile." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "One-time security upgrade: enter the code we emailed to %1$@. Your account then moves to the new wallet your new password creates. Your previous wallet (%2$@) stays behind, and so does its public profile."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Actualización de seguridad única: introduce el código que enviamos a %1$@. Después, tu cuenta pasa a la nueva billetera que crea tu nueva contraseña. Tu billetera anterior (%2$@) se queda atrás, y también su perfil público."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mise à niveau de sécurité unique : saisissez le code envoyé par e-mail à %1$@. Votre compte est ensuite transféré vers le nouveau portefeuille créé par votre nouveau mot de passe. Votre ancien portefeuille (%2$@) reste en place, tout comme son profil public."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1회 보안 업그레이드: %1$@ 주소로 보낸 코드를 입력하세요. 그러면 계정이 새 비밀번호로 생성되는 새 지갑으로 옮겨져요. 이전 지갑(%2$@)과 그 공개 프로필은 그대로 남아요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一次性安全升级：输入我们发送到 %1$@ 的验证码。之后你的账户会迁移到由新密码创建的新钱包。你之前的钱包（%2$@）及其公开资料都会留在原处。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only NFTs received since %@ are listed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Solo se muestran los NFT recibidos desde el %@."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Seuls les NFT reçus depuis le %@ sont affichés."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 이후 받은 NFT만 표시돼요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅列出自 %@ 以来收到的 NFT。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only enter it into a wallet you trust (MetaMask, Rabby, OKX…). A hardware wallet is safest." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Introdúcela solo en una billetera de confianza (MetaMask, Rabby, OKX…). Una billetera de hardware es lo más seguro."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ne la saisissez que dans un portefeuille de confiance (MetaMask, Rabby, OKX…). Un portefeuille matériel est le plus sûr."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "신뢰할 수 있는 지갑(MetaMask, Rabby, OKX…)에만 입력하십시오. 하드웨어 지갑이 가장 안전합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只能将其输入你信任的钱包（MetaMask、Rabby、OKX…）。硬件钱包最安全。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only enter them into a wallet you trust (MetaMask, Rabby, OKX…). A hardware wallet is safest." : {
