    "Order sent, but Perpl didn't accept the stop-loss. Set it with TP/SL on the position once the order fills." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orden enviada, pero Perpl no aceptó el stop loss. Configúralo con TP/SL en la posición cuando se ejecute la orden."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ordre envoyé, mais Perpl n'a pas accepté le stop loss. Définissez-le avec « TP/SL » sur la position une fois l'ordre exécuté."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "주문은 전송되었지만 Perpl이 손절 주문을 받아들이지 않았습니다. 주문이 체결되면 포지션의 익절/손절에서 설정하십시오."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "订单已发送，但 Perpl 未接受止损。订单成交后，在仓位上通过“止盈/止损”设置止损。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Order sent, but Perpl didn't accept the take-profit and stop-loss. Set them with TP/SL on the position once the order fills." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
