    "Perpl accepted the new stop-loss but hasn't listed it yet. Check Orders before placing it again." : {
      "comment" : "The position's TP/SL sheet: Perpl took the new stop-loss, but its live list didn't show it in time, so it may or may not be active. Orders is a tab of the Perps screen.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Perpl aceptó el nuevo stop loss, pero aún no lo ha listado. Revisa Órdenes antes de volver a colocarlo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Perpl a accepté le nouveau stop loss, mais ne l'a pas encore listé. Vérifiez Ordres avant de le placer à nouveau."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Perpl이 새 손절 주문을 접수했지만 아직 목록에 올리지 않았습니다. 다시 넣기 전에 주문을 확인하십시오."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Perpl 已接受新的止损，但尚未列出。再次下单前，先查看“委托”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Perpl accepted the new stop-loss but hasn't listed it yet. The old one was cancelled. Check Orders before placing it again." : {
      "comment" : "The position's TP/SL sheet: the old stop-loss was cancelled; Perpl took the new one, but its live list didn't show it in time, so it may or may not be active. Orders is a tab of the Perps screen.",
