    "Placed on Perpl as keeper triggers that close this order's size (%@). The size is fixed: they don't grow if you add to the position later." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se colocan en Perpl como disparadores de keeper que cierran el tamaño de esta orden (%@). El tamaño es fijo: no aumentan si luego añades a la posición."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Placés sur Perpl comme déclencheurs keeper qui clôturent la taille de cet ordre (%@). La taille est fixe : ils n'augmentent pas si vous renforcez la position plus tard."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Perpl에 이 주문 수량(%@)을 종료하는 키퍼 트리거로 설정돼요. 수량은 고정되어 있어, 나중에 포지션을 늘려도 함께 늘어나지 않아요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以 Keeper 触发单的形式下在 Perpl 上，平仓数量为此订单的数量（%@）。该数量是固定的：如果之后加仓，它们不会随之增加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Placed on Perpl as keeper triggers that close this order's size only (%@), not your whole %@ position. For all of it, use TP/SL on the position." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Placed on Perpl as keeper triggers that close this order's size only (%1$@), not your whole %2$@ position. For all of it, use TP/SL on the position."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se colocan en Perpl como disparadores de keeper que cierran solo el tamaño de esta orden (%1$@), no toda tu posición de %2$@. Para cerrarla entera, usa TP/SL en la posición."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Placés sur Perpl comme déclencheurs keeper qui clôturent uniquement la taille de cet ordre (%1$@), et non toute votre position %2$@. Pour la totalité, utilisez « TP/SL » sur la position."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Perpl에 전체 %2$@ 포지션이 아닌 이 주문 수량(%1$@)만 종료하는 키퍼 트리거로 설정돼요. 전체를 종료하려면 포지션의 익절/손절을 사용하세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以 Keeper 触发单的形式下在 Perpl 上，只平掉此订单的数量（%1$@），而不是你的整个 %2$@ 仓位。如需平掉整个仓位，在仓位上使用“止盈/止损”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Placed on Perpl as keeper triggers that close this order's size only, not your whole %@ position. For all of it, use TP/SL on the position." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se colocan en Perpl como disparadores de keeper que cierran solo el tamaño de esta orden, no toda tu posición de %@. Para cerrarla entera, usa TP/SL en la posición."
