            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "价格为 %@ 的新止损立即触发了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new take-profit at %@ triggered at once." : {
      "comment" : "The position's TP/SL sheet: the new take-profit fired as soon as Perpl armed it, so Perpl is closing the position at its price. The value: its trigger price.",
