          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The order filled before the cancel landed." : {
      "comment" : "Cancel Order sheet: it filled before Perpl processed the cancel.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La orden se ejecutó antes de que se procesara la cancelación."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L'ordre a été exécuté avant que l'annulation ne soit traitée."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "취소가 처리되기 전에 주문이 체결되었습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该委托在取消生效前已成交。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The order had already expired." : {
      "comment" : "Cancel Order sheet: it had expired before Perpl processed the cancel.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La orden ya había expirado."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L'ordre avait déjà expiré."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "주문은 이미 만료되었습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该委托已过期。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The order is on the book, but Perpl didn't accept the stop-loss. Set it with TP/SL on the position once the order fills." : {
      "comment" : "A Perps order sheet's warning: the limit order rests on the order book; Perpl refused its stop-loss.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La orden está en el libro de órdenes, pero Perpl no aceptó el stop loss. Configúralo con TP/SL en la posición cuando se ejecute la orden."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L'ordre est dans le carnet, mais Perpl n'a pas accepté le stop loss. Définissez-le avec « TP/SL » sur la position une fois l'ordre exécuté."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "주문이 호가창에 접수되었지만 Perpl이 손절 주문을 받아들이지 않았습니다. 주문이 체결되면 포지션의 익절/손절에서 설정하십시오."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "订单已挂单，但 Perpl 未接受止损。订单成交后，在仓位上通过“止盈/止损”设置止损。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The order is on the book, but Perpl didn't accept the take-profit and stop-loss. Set them with TP/SL on the position once the order fills." : {
      "comment" : "A Perps order sheet's warning: the limit order rests on the order book; Perpl refused its take-profit and stop-loss.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La orden está en el libro de órdenes, pero Perpl no aceptó el take profit ni el stop loss. Configúralos con TP/SL en la posición cuando se ejecute la orden."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L'ordre est dans le carnet, mais Perpl n'a pas accepté le take profit et le stop loss. Définissez-les avec « TP/SL » sur la position une fois l'ordre exécuté."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "주문이 호가창에 접수되었지만 Perpl이 익절 및 손절 주문을 받아들이지 않았습니다. 주문이 체결되면 포지션의 익절/손절에서 설정하십시오."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "订单已挂单，但 Perpl 未接受止盈和止损。订单成交后，在仓位上通过“止盈/止损”进行设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The order is on the book, but Perpl didn't accept the take-profit. Set it with TP/SL on the position once the order fills." : {
      "comment" : "A Perps order sheet's warning: the limit order rests on the order book; Perpl refused its take-profit.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La orden está en el libro de órdenes, pero Perpl no aceptó el take profit. Configúralo con TP/SL en la posición cuando se ejecute la orden."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L'ordre est dans le carnet, mais Perpl n'a pas accepté le take profit. Définissez-le avec « TP/SL » sur la position une fois l'ordre exécuté."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "주문이 호가창에 접수되었지만 Perpl이 익절 주문을 받아들이지 않았습니다. 주문이 체결되면 포지션의 익절/손절에서 설정하십시오."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "订单已挂单，但 Perpl 未接受止盈。订单成交后，在仓位上通过“止盈/止损”设置止盈。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The order was already gone." : {
      "comment" : "Cancel Order sheet: the order was no longer on Perpl when the cancel would have gone out; nothing was sent, or nothing was there to cancel.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La orden ya no existía."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L'ordre n'existait déjà plus."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "주문은 이미 없어진 상태였습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该委托已不存在。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The order was cancelled." : {
      "comment" : "Cancel Order sheet: Perpl's live list confirms the resting order was cancelled.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La orden se canceló."
          }
