    "Up to %@ per action and %@ per session, and only when DyorHQ can price it. Every transaction is also checked on its own: the right chain and contract, approvals for exactly the amount shown, and the output coming back to you." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Up to %1$@ per action and %2$@ per session, and only when DyorHQ can price it. Every transaction is also checked on its own: the right chain and contract, approvals for exactly the amount shown, and the output coming back to you."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hasta %1$@ por acción y %2$@ por sesión, y solo cuando DyorHQ puede ponerle precio. Además, cada transacción se comprueba por separado: la cadena y el contrato correctos, aprobaciones por la cantidad exacta que se muestra y que el resultado vuelva a ti."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jusqu'à %1$@ par action et %2$@ par session, et seulement lorsque DyorHQ peut en estimer le prix. Chaque transaction est aussi vérifiée individuellement : la bonne chaîne et le bon contrat, des approbations pour exactement le montant affiché, et le résultat qui vous revient."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "작업당 최대 %1$@, 세션당 최대 %2$@까지이며, DyorHQ가 가격을 산정할 수 있을 때만 해당됩니다. 모든 트랜잭션은 개별적으로도 확인됩니다: 올바른 체인과 컨트랙트인지, 표시된 금액만큼만 승인하는지, 결과물이 나에게 돌아오는지."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次操作最多 %1$@，每个会话最多 %2$@，且仅限 DyorHQ 能够计价的情况。每笔交易还会单独检查：链和合约正确、授权数量与显示的金额完全一致，且输出返回给你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
